            "bbox": [
              56.69218444824219,
              466.5589904785156,
              351.7860107421875,
              476.54998779296875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "HaKadosh Baruj Hu son absolutamente uno.[13] Se sigue que "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.69300842285156,
              478.39996337890625,
              351.7799987792969,
              488.53997802734375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                2
              ]
            ],
            "text": "cuando existe un punto bueno dentro del judío -es decir, "
          },
          {
