            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                14,
                6
              ]
            ],
            "text": "14 En el LM I, 5:2, el Rebe Najmán enseña que “HaKadosh "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.69309997558594,
              638.971435546875,
