        "bbox": [
          82.0282974243164,
          235.44798278808594,
          411.1232604980469,
          280.24798583984375
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.0282974243164,
              235.44798278808594,
              411.11920166015625,
              244.9679718017578
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Habiendo explicado que al encontrar el punto bueno despertamos la "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.0282974243164,
              247.44798278808594,
              411.1182556152344,
              256.9679870605469
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "bondad de HaShem y obtenemos Su perdón, el Rabí Natán continúa "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.0282974243164,
              259.4479675292969,
              411.1232604980469,
              268.9679870605469
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                2
              ]
            ],
            "text": "demostrando cómo esto está específicamente aludido en los Trece Atributos "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.0282974243164,
              272.6479797363281,
              152.0482940673828,
              280.24798583984375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                3
              ]
            ],
            "text": "de Misericordia."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          53.62800598144531,
          288.3580017089844,
          353.89434814453125,
          394.0379638671875
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.0282974243164,
              288.3580017089844,
              353.89434814453125,
              300.2980041503906
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Éste es el concepto de los Trece Atributos de Misericordia "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.6282958984375,
              302.3380126953125,
              353.8882751464844,
              312.1579895019531
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "tal cual se encuentran en el versículo “¡HaShem! ¡HaShem! "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.6282958984375,
              314.447998046875,
              353.8863220214844,
              324.2980041503906
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                2
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Dios piadoso, misericordioso y lento para la ira…”. HaShem "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.6282958984375,
              324.3580017089844,
              353.8783264160156,
              336.2980041503906
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                3
              ]
            ],
            "text": "está pleno de compasión y es “bueno para todo”. Él es "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.6282958984375,
              336.3580017089844,
              353.7992858886719,
              348.2980041503906
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                4
              ]
            ],
            "text": "paciente con los rectos y con los malvados. Pues “Él inclina la "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.6282958984375,
              350.3170166015625,
              353.8910217285156,
              360.2980041503906
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                5
              ]
            ],
            "text": "balanza de la justicia hacia jesed”[23] y juzga a todos de manera "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.62800598144531,
              360.35797119140625,
              353.87603759765625,
              372.2979736328125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                6
              ]
            ],
            "text": "favorable. Él también encuentra el punto bueno incluso en "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.62800598144531,
              374.157958984375,
              353.88702392578125,
              384.2979736328125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                7
              ]
            ],
            "text": "los pecadores judíos y así inclina la balanza para ellos hacia el "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.62800598144531,
              386.157958984375,
              132.01800537109375,
              394.0379638671875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                8
              ]
            ],
            "text": "lado del mérito."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 6,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          359.4330139160156,
          288.9629821777344,
          440.8009948730469,
          392.01904296875
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              359.4330139160156,
              288.9629821777344,
              436.7610168457031,
              296.5789794921875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "“¡HaShem! ¡HaShem! "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              359.4330139160156,
              298.56298828125,
              409.2409973144531,
              306.1789855957031
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Dios piadoso, "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              359.4330139160156,
              308.1629943847656,
              438.1289978027344,
              315.77899169921875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                2
              ]
            ],
            "text": "misericordioso y lento "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              359.4330139160156,
              317.76300048828125,
              437.2409973144531,
              325.3789978027344
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                3
              ]
            ],
            "text": "para la ira, abundante "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              359.4330139160156,
              327.29901123046875,
              423.0570068359375,
              335.39501953125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                4
              ]
            ],
            "text": "en jesed (bondad) "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              359.4330139160156,
              335.6430358886719,
              427.8970031738281,
              344.6190185546875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                5
              ]
            ],
            "text": "y verdad. Él guarda "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              359.4330139160156,
              346.4990234375,
              424.37701416015625,
              354.59503173828125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                6
              ]
            ],
            "text": "el jesed por miles, "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              359.4330139160156,
              356.16302490234375,
              439.9209899902344,
              363.7790222167969
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                7
              ]
            ],
            "text": "perdona la iniquidad y "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              359.4330139160156,
              365.7630310058594,
              440.8009948730469,
              373.3790283203125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                8
              ]
            ],
            "text": "la rebelión y el pecado "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              359.4330139160156,
              375.363037109375,
              393.2170104980469,
              382.9790344238281
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                9
              ]
            ],
            "text": "y limpia”."
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              359.4330139160156,
              384.5559997558594,
              404.3479919433594,
              392.01904296875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                10
              ]
            ],
            "text": "(Éxodo 34:6-7)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 7,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          53.628021240234375,
          399.19195556640625,
          442.1029052734375,
          507.1419677734375
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.02800750732422,
              399.19195556640625,
              442.09600830078125,
              411.1319580078125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                9
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Éste es el signifi cado de “Él guarda el jesed por miles”. El concepto de "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.628021240234375,
              413.27197265625,
              442.08709716796875,
              423.1419677734375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                10
              ]
            ],
            "text": "jesed es que HaShem Se inclina hacia la bondad, juzga favorablemente y "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.628021240234375,
              425.1719665527344,
              442.0030517578125,
              435.1319580078125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                11
              ]
            ],
            "text": "encuentra un punto bueno incluso en el judío menos digno, permitiéndole así "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.628021240234375,
              436.7906188964844,
              442.1029052734375,
              447.1319580078125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                12
              ]
            ],
            "text": "hacer teshuvá. Este jesed refrena la ira Divina y mitiga los juicios severos “por "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.6280517578125,
              449.2819519042969,
              442.1002197265625,
              459.1419677734375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                13
              ]
            ],
            "text": "miles” de pecados. En otras palabras, incluso aunque los miles y las decenas de "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.6280517578125,
              461.1719665527344,
              442.1000671386719,
              471.1419677734375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                14
              ]
            ],
            "text": "miles de transgresiones que la persona ha cometido contrarrestan su mérito, el "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.628082275390625,
              473.2819519042969,
              442.0101013183594,
              483.1419677734375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                15
              ]
            ],
            "text": "poco de bien que HaShem encuentra al inclinarse hacia la bondad repele todo "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.6280517578125,
              484.991943359375,
              442.0110778808594,
              495.1419677734375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                16
              ]
            ],
            "text": "esto. Como resultado, HaShem “perdona la iniquidad y la rebelión” y perdona "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.6280517578125,
              496.991943359375,
              439.1471862792969,
              507.1419677734375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                17
              ]
            ],
            "text": "las ofensas del pecador, de modo que genuinamente se vuelve digno del mérito."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 8,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          82.0280532836914,
          514.8219604492188,
          411.1239929199219,
          572.3419189453125
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.0280532836914,
              514.8219604492188,
              411.115966796875,
              524.3419189453125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                3,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "El Rabí Natán ha explicado que los Trece Atributos de Misericordia de "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.0280532836914,
              526.8219604492188,
              411.1150817871094,
              536.3419189453125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                3,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "HaShem despiertan el punto bueno en cada ser humano, incluso en el "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.0280532836914,
              538.8219604492188,
              411.1239929199219,
              548.3919677734375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                3,
                2
              ]
            ],
            "text": "menos digno. Al inclinarse hacia la bondad -es decir, Su atributo de bondad- "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.0280532836914,
              550.8219604492188,
              411.1219787597656,
              560.3419189453125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                3,
                3
              ]
            ],
            "text": "HaShem lleva a la persona hacia una posición de mérito y la motiva a "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.0280532836914,
              561.1719360351562,
              392.7180480957031,
              572.3419189453125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                3,
                4
              ]
            ],
            "text": "arrepentirse, de modo que Él la perdona entonces de todos sus pecados."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 9,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          224.7550048828125,
          581.35009765625,
          272.7260437011719,
          588.447998046875
        ],
