              53.80401611328125,
              251.4359588623047,
              351.6110534667969,
              261.5859680175781
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                4
              ]
            ],
            "text": "con las palabras “Dios mío, abre mis labios…”. Porque es "
          },
