              441.2483215332031,
              564.44384765625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                14,
                3
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Enseña lo siguiente: El rúaj TzaFóN ( )רוח צפוֹן-que soplaba "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              252.61358642578125,
              566.61767578125,
              441.2438049316406,
              573.44384765625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                14,
                4
              ]
            ],
            "text": "sobre el arpa de David HaMelej, como en “el rúaj de Dios "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              252.61282348632812,
              575.61767578125,
              439.36956787109375,
              582.44384765625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                14,
                5
              ]
            ],
            "text": "sobrevolaba” (ver §8 más arriba)- corresponde al rúaj ha-"
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              252.61282348632812,
              584.61767578125,
              441.2684326171875,
              591.42919921875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                14,
                6
              ]
            ],
            "text": "TzaFúN ( ,)רוח הצפוּןel espíritu oculto en el corazón del hombre, "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              252.61282348632812,
              593.61767578125,
              318.8497619628906,
              600.44384765625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                14,
                7
              ]
            ],
            "text": "que es el rúaj de vida."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 12,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          252.61279296875,
          602.61767578125,
          441.2631530761719,
          627.44384765625
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              252.61279296875,
