              536.0026245117188
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                6,
                7
              ]
            ],
            "text": "poder de visión y de supervisión de HaShem (ver la nota 16 "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.85981750488281,
              538.1727905273438,
              242.5126495361328,
              545.0026245117188
            ],
            "ids": [
