        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.834598541259766,
              194.58802795410156,
              442.3080139160156,
              204.56906127929688
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "de la garganta.[72] De esa manera se impide que emerja el habla sagrada,[73] y uno es "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.83502197265625,
              206.65798950195312,
              357.1338195800781,
              216.56906127929688
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "incapaz de pronunciar una sola palabra delante de HaShem.[74]"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 6,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          82.23457336425781,
          224.2579803466797,
          411.3346252441406,
          293.7779846191406
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.2345962524414,
              224.2579803466797,
              411.3346252441406,
              233.77796936035156
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "El Rabí Natán explica que cuando el habla de la persona desciende hacia el "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.2345962524414,
              236.0979766845703,
              411.32855224609375,
              246.41796875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "exilio de Mitzraim/meitzar hagarón, su incapacidad de hablar ante HaShem "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.23458862304688,
              248.2579803466797,
              411.3255615234375,
              257.8279724121094
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                2
