            ],
            "text": "7 ■ BUSCANDO AL TZADIK"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 6,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          85.09269714355469,
          400.8779602050781,
          414.19464111328125,
          446.3979797363281
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              85.09269714355469,
              400.8779602050781,
              414.19464111328125,
              410.3979797363281
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "El Rabí Natán interpreta ahora varios versículos del Libro de Proverbios como "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              85.09269714355469,
              412.86798095703125,
              414.1765441894531,
              422.3979797363281
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "haciendo referencia a la búsqueda del Tzadik, cuya cercanía le permite a la "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              85.09269714355469,
              424.8779602050781,
              414.1805725097656,
              434.3979797363281
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                2
              ]
            ],
            "text": "persona alcanzar todo aquello que le falta en la vida, tanto material como "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              85.09269714355469,
              436.8779602050781,
              127.33268737792969,
              446.3979797363281
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                7,
                3
              ]
            ],
            "text": "espiritual."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 7,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          56.692718505859375,
          454.636962890625,
          445.1640625,
          510.2669677734375
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              85.09269714355469,
              454.636962890625,
              445.1587219238281,
              463.84698486328125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Para encontrar al verdadero Tzadik, uno no debe concederle “sueño a sus "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.692718505859375,
              466.386962890625,
              445.1640625,
              476.5369873046875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "ojos ni adormecimiento a sus párpados”.[52] Debe viajar en su búsqueda y elevar "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.693023681640625,
              478.386962890625,
              445.15509033203125,
              488.5269775390625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                2
              ]
            ],
            "text": "muchas plegarias y súplicas para tener el mérito de encontrar al verdadero "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.693023681640625,
              490.386962890625,
              445.15911865234375,
              500.5369873046875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                3
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Tzadik que pueda curarlo e instilar en él una percepción de Divinidad, para "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.693023681640625,
              502.386962890625,
              216.6970672607422,
              510.2669677734375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                4
              ]
            ],
            "text": "salvar su alma de la destrucción."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 8,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          56.693023681640625,
          517.2219848632812,
          323.9841003417969,
          599.3619995117188
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              85.09302520751953,
              517.2219848632812,
              323.9820556640625,
              527.3619995117188
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                5
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Shlomo HaMelej, la paz sea sobre él, clamó sobre "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.693023681640625,
              529.4719848632812,
              323.98297119140625,
              539.3619995117188
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                6
              ]
            ],
            "text": "esto en Proverbios, “No le concedas sueño a tus ojos ni "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.693023681640625,
              541.2219848632812,
              323.9779968261719,
              551.3619995117188
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                7
              ]
            ],
            "text": "adormecimiento a tus párpados. Libérate como corzo "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.693023681640625,
              553.5120239257812,
              323.9841003417969,
              563.3619995117188
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                8
              ]
            ],
            "text": "de la mano [del cazador] y como el ave de la trampa”. "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.693023681640625,
              563.4219970703125,
              323.9780578613281,
              575.3619995117188
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                9
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Éste consejo se cumple cuando la persona busca hasta "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.693023681640625,
              577.2219848632812,
              323.97509765625,
              587.3720092773438
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                10
              ]
            ],
            "text": "encontrar al Tzadik, el verdadero líder que la llevará "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              56.693023681640625,
              587.4219970703125,
              323.89007568359375,
              599.3619995117188
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                11
              ]
            ],
            "text": "cerca de HaShem. Éste es el significado de lo que está "
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 9,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          329.52801513671875,
          514.60107421875,
          446.447998046875,
          598.4571533203125
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              329.52801513671875,
              514.60107421875,
              434.0159912109375,
              522.2171020507812
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                17,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "“Haz esto entonces, hijo mío, "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              329.52801513671875,
              524.2010498046875,
              434.4639892578125,
              531.8170776367188
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                17,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "pues has caído en la mano de "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              329.52801513671875,
              533.8010864257812,
              440.239990234375,
              541.4570922851562
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                17,
                2
              ]
            ],
            "text": "tu amigo. Humíllate e insta a tu "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              329.52801513671875,
              543.401123046875,
              440.239990234375,
              551.05712890625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                17,
                3
              ]
            ],
            "text": "amigo. No le concedas sueño a "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              329.52801513671875,
              553.0010986328125,
              443.79998779296875,
              560.6171264648438
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                17,
                4
              ]
            ],
            "text": "tus ojos ni adormecimiento a tus "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              329.52801513671875,
              562.60107421875,
              438.89599609375,
              570.2171020507812
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                17,
                5
              ]
            ],
            "text": "párpados. Libérate como corzo "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              329.52801513671875,
              572.2011108398438,
              446.447998046875,
              579.817138671875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                17,
                6
              ]
            ],
            "text": "de la mano [del cazador] y como "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              329.52801513671875,
              581.8010864257812,
              401.09600830078125,
              589.4171142578125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                17,
                7
              ]
            ],
            "text": "el ave de la trampa”."
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              329.52801513671875,
              591.8809814453125,
              383.77301025390625,
              598.4571533203125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                17,
                8
              ]
            ],
            "text": "(Proverbios 6:3-5)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 10,
        "class": "footnote",
        "bbox": [
