      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          53.858184814453125,
          293.095947265625,
          442.33233642578125,
          411.2359619140625
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.25830078125,
              293.095947265625,
              442.3223876953125,
              303.2359619140625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Esto puede explicarse por medio de una analogía. Cuando la persona está "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.858299255371094,
              305.3859558105469,
              442.3323059082031,
              315.2359619140625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "sana, el rey ciertamente no va hacia ella para mostrarle su panim. En su lugar, "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.858306884765625,
              317.095947265625,
              442.3303527832031,
              327.2459716796875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                2
              ]
            ],
            "text": "todo aquel que quiera saludar al rey y disfrutar del brillo de su panim deberá "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.85833740234375,
              328.9759521484375,
              442.326416015625,
              339.2359619140625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                3
              ]
            ],
            "text": "primero limpiarse y purifi carse muy bien y vestir prendas apropiadas. Entonces "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.85834503173828,
              341.095947265625,
              442.3244934082031,
              351.2359619140625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                4
              ]
            ],
            "text": "deberá colocarse ante los portales del rey y rogarle a la guardia personal del "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.85834503173828,
              353.095947265625,
              442.33233642578125,
              363.2459716796875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                5
              ]
            ],
            "text": "rey[107] que le deje entrar. Deberá apelar a toda clase de estrategias para que "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.85820007324219,
              365.345947265625,
              442.2402038574219,
              375.2359619140625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                6
              ]
            ],
            "text": "finalmente se le permita presentar delante del rey, de acuerdo a su nivel -lo "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.858184814453125,
              377.3859558105469,
              442.3321228027344,
              387.2359619140625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                7
              ]
            ],
            "text": "que implica que se le otorgue permiso para entrar hasta el patio del rey o hasta el "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.85820007324219,
              389.095947265625,
              442.3262939453125,
              399.2459716796875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                8
              ]
            ],
            "text": "palacio o hasta la cámara interior- para que el rey lo ilumine con la luz de su "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.85820007324219,
              401.3859558105469,
              132.1562042236328,
              411.2359619140625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                9
              ]
            ],
            "text": "radiante panim."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 6,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          53.856231689453125,
          416.179931640625,
          442.3493347167969,
          483.8199462890625
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.25719451904297,
              416.179931640625,
              442.3493347167969,
              426.0799560546875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                10
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Pero es diferente cuando es uno del entorno del rey quien se enferma y se "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.857200622558594,
              427.8099365234375,
              442.3382568359375,
              438.0799560546875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                11
              ]
            ],
            "text": "ve confi nado a su lecho, que HaShem nos salve. Entonces, cuando la compasión "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.857200622558594,
              440.2199401855469,
              442.3302307128906,
              450.0699462890625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                12
              ]
            ],
            "text": "del rey se despierta para revivir a esa persona con la luz de su panim, el rey se "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.857208251953125,
              452.2199401855469,
              424.697998046875,
              462.0699462890625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                13
              ],
              [
                12,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "ve compelido a visitarla en su hogar para iluminarla con la luz “Susténtenme "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.857208251953125,
              462.12994384765625,
              436.2659912109375,
              474.0699462890625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                14
              ],
              [
                12,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "de su panim y revivir su espíritu. Ésta es la idea de “la Shejiná se [en el exilio] con "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              375.35400390625,
              472.7149658203125,
              438.489990234375,
              480.3309631347656
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                12,
                2
              ]
            ],
            "text": "pasteles de pasas, "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.856231689453125,
              476.2099609375,
              257.6202697753906,
              483.8199462890625
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                15
              ]
            ],
            "text": "encuentra sobre la cabecera del enfermo”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 7,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          375.35400390625,
          453.8749694824219,
          441.15399169921875,
          546.9710083007812
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              375.35400390625,
              453.8749694824219,
              424.697998046875,
              459.60296630859375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                12,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "“Susténtenme "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              375.35400390625,
              463.114990234375,
              436.2659912109375,
              470.0270080566406
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                12,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "[en el exilio] con "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              375.35400390625,
              472.7149658203125,
              438.489990234375,
              480.3309631347656
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                12,
                2
              ]
            ],
            "text": "pasteles de pasas, "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              375.35400390625,
              482.31500244140625,
              436.2659912109375,
              488.39501953125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                12,
                3
              ]
            ],
            "text": "confórtenme con "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              375.35400390625,
              491.91497802734375,
              433.58599853515625,
              499.57098388671875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                12,
                4
              ]
            ],
            "text": "[la fragancia de] "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              375.35400390625,
              503.60302734375,
              441.15399169921875,
              509.1310119628906
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                12,
                5
              ]
            ],
            "text": "manzanas, porque "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              375.35400390625,
              511.114990234375,
              436.25799560546875,
              518.7310180664062
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                12,
                6
              ]
            ],
            "text": "estoy enferma de "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              375.35400390625,
              521.0030517578125,
              398.906005859375,
              526.7870483398438
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                12,
                7
              ]
            ],
            "text": "amor”."
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              375.35400390625,
              530.7949829101562,
              419.2070617675781,
              537.3710327148438
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                12,
                8
              ]
            ],
            "text": "(Cantar de los Cantar de los "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              375.3540954589844,
              540.3949584960938,
              415.31500244140625,
              546.9710083007812
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                12,
                9
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Cantares 2:5))"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 8,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          53.85621643066406,
          490.76495361328125,
          442.3152770996094,
          572.9049682617188
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.25623321533203,
              490.76495361328125,
              433.58599853515625,
              500.90496826171875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                16
              ],
              [
                12,
                4
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Esto se relaciona con Jánuca y con Purim en el sentido de [la fragancia de] "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.856231689453125,
              502.76495361328125,
              441.15399169921875,
              512.9149780273438
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                17
              ],
              [
                12,
                5
              ]
            ],
            "text": "que éstas son festividades santas que nos fueron otorgadas para manzanas, porque "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              375.35400390625,
              511.114990234375,
              436.25799560546875,
              518.7310180664062
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                12,
                6
              ]
            ],
            "text": "estoy enferma de "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.856231689453125,
              514.7649536132812,
              398.906005859375,
              526.7870483398438
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                18
              ],
              [
                12,
                7
              ]
            ],
            "text": "darnos vida hasta este mismo día - en esta época de amargo amor”."
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.856231689453125,
              526.7649536132812,
              419.2070617675781,
              537.3710327148438
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                19
              ],
              [
                12,
                8
              ]
            ],
            "text": "exilio cuando, como escribe el Zohar, el pueblo judío es llamado (Cantar de los Cantar de los "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.85621643066406,
              538.7649536132812,
              415.31500244140625,
              548.3349609375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                20
              ],
              [
                12,
                9
              ]
            ],
            "text": "“enfermo”, como está aludido en “Susténtenme [en el exilio] Cantares 2:5))"
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.85621643066406,
              550.7649536132812,
              442.3152770996094,
              560.9149780273438
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                21
              ]
            ],
            "text": "con pasteles de pasas, confórtenme con [la fragancia de] manzanas, porque "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.85621643066406,
              562.9241333007812,
              184.98626708984375,
              572.9049682617188
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                1,
                22
              ]
            ],
            "text": "estoy enferma de amor”.[108]"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 9,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          53.858306884765625,
          577.8800048828125,
          442.3302307128906,
          599.739990234375
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              82.25830078125,
              577.8800048828125,
              442.3302307128906,
              587.739990234375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                2,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Y debido a la inmensa severidad de la enfermedad espiritual, somos "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.858306884765625,
              589.5999755859375,
              442.32635498046875,
              599.739990234375
            ],
            "ids": [
