              56.692604064941406,
              476.96697998046875,
              443.9979553222656,
              489.7550048828125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                8,
                5
              ],
              [
                18,
                2
              ]
            ],
            "text": "“El sol sale y el sol se pone”. Afi rman Jazal interpretando esto Miren, el sol, la luna "
          },
