              442.3310546875,
              286.31396484375
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                11,
                0
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Este discurso se basa en la lección del Rebe Najmán Tikú Tojajá, LM II, 8. "
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.858123779296875,
              288.053955078125,
              296.8351135253906,
              298.24395751953125
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                11,
                1
              ]
            ],
            "text": "Estudia allí toda la lección, del comienzo al fi nal."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "index": 7,
        "class": "text",
        "bbox": [
          53.858001708984375,
          303.1679992675781,
          442.3299865722656,
          370.88897705078125
