          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              53.85830307006836,
              368.1424560546875,
              242.49684143066406,
              374.9686279296875
            ],
            "ids": [
              [
                10,
                5
              ]
            ],
            "text": "fortaleza, para que tú gobiernes be-kerev ( ,בקרבlit. “dentro”) "
          },
